      "comment": "BLANKET GAME (3) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.07 beating Jill's Fantasy. Ideally placed to take this out. MOLLY MCKAYLA (5) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (22.79) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. ASTON TORTA (2) is long overdue for a win and in super consistent form, jumping from this box to place last time at Mt Gambier (17.55), making it three straight minors. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. LAURISTON GIRL (8) warrants respect following a recent placing at big odds.",
